现CI/CD自动化，提升开发效率与凭证安全性。</summary> </entry> <entry><title>Medium API 爬取资料与突破 Cloudflare 防护｜完整 GraphQL 操作教学</title><link href="https://zh-hans.zhgchg.li/posts/zrealm-dev/medium-api-%E7%88%AC%E5%8F%96%E8%B5%84%E6%96%99%E4%B8%8E%E7%AA%81%E7%A0%B4-cloudflare-%E9%98%B2%E6%8A%A4-%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4-graphql-%E6%93%8D%E4%BD%9C%E6%95%99%E5%AD%A6-88f0fb935120/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="Medium API 爬取资料与突破 Cloudflare 防护｜完整 GraphQL 操作教学" /><published>2025-12-31T12:36:53+08:00</published> <updated>2026-01-02T22:43:48+08:00</updated> <id>https://zh-hans.zhgchg.li/posts/zrealm-dev/medium-api-%E7%88%AC%E5%8F%96%E8%B5%84%E6%96%99%E4%B8%8E%E7%AA%81%E7%A0%B4-cloudflare-%E9%98%B2%E6%8A%A4-%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4-graphql-%E6%93%8D%E4%BD%9C%E6%95%99%E5%AD%A6-88f0fb935120/</id> <content type="text/html" src="https://zh-hans.zhgchg.li/posts/zrealm-dev/medium-api-%E7%88%AC%E5%8F%96%E8%B5%84%E6%96%99%E4%B8%8E%E7%AA%81%E7%A0%B4-cloudflare-%E9%98%B2%E6%8A%A4-%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4-graphql-%E6%93%8D%E4%BD%9C%E6%95%99%E5%AD%A6-88f0fb935120/" /> <author> <name>ZhgChgLi</name> </author> <category term="ZRealm Dev." /> <summary>针对 Medium 使用者担心文章无备份、Cloudflare 阻挡爬虫的痛点，详解如何透过 Medium API 与 GraphQL 取得追踪人数、文章列表及内容，并示范用 Cloudflare Worker 成功绕过防护，实现自动备份与资料同步。</summary> </entry> <entry><title>App Store Connect API Webhook 串接｜提升 iOS CI/CD 自动化效率与通知流程</title><link href="https://zh-hans.zhgchg.li/posts/zrealm-dev/app-store-connect-api-webhook-%E4%B8%B2%E6%8E%A5-%E6%8F%90%E5%8D%87-ios-ci-cd-%E8%87%AA%E5%8A%A8%E5%8C%96%E6%95%88%E7%8E%87%E4%B8%8E%E9%80%9A%E7%9F%A5%E6%B5%81%E7%A8%8B-7c0974856393/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="App Store Connect API Webhook 串接｜提升 iOS CI/CD 自动化效率与通知流程" /><published>2025-12-27T17:02:01+08:00</published> <updated>2025-12-27T17:05:14+08:00</updated> <id>https://zh-hans.zhgchg.li/posts/zrealm-dev/app-store-connect-api-webhook-%E4%B8%B2%E6%8E%A5-%E6%8F%90%E5%8D%87-ios-ci-cd-%E8%87%AA%E5%8A%A8%E5%8C%96%E6%95%88%E7%8E%87%E4%B8%8E%E9%80%9A%E7%9F%A5%E6%B5%81%E7%A8%8B-7c0974856393